infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\cos(pz)\\cos(pz')}{p^2+k^2}\\,dp=\\frac{\\pi}{2k}\\l\
eft(e^{-k|z-z'|}+e^{-k(z+z')}\\right).", "state" -> "Boxes"|>, 
